### [Negative][Register] FirstName over 50 chars (400 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "{{Over50Name}}", "lastName": "Smith", "email": "firstname.toolong.{{RunId}}@example.test", "password": "{{TestPassword}}", "personType": "Mechanic", "specialization": "GasolineAndDiesel", "expertise": ["Engine"] }

?? status == 400
?? js (Object.values(response.parsedBody.errors).flat().includes("FirstName must be at most 50 characters.")) == true

