### [Negative][Register] Email over 150 chars is refused on the Email field (400 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Valid", "lastName": "Smith", "email": "{{Over150LocalPart}}@example.test", "password": "{{TestPassword}}", "personType": "Mechanic", "specialization": "GasolineAndDiesel", "expertise": ["Engine"] }

?? status == 400
?? js (Object.keys(response.parsedBody.errors).map(k => k.toLowerCase()).includes("email")) == true

